  },
  {
   "id": "text90",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 580,
   "y": 180,
   "width": 327.59999999999997,
   "height": 350.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1527703408,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 956887592,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Parameters\n  NSlice, Lanes  array size\n  MaxK           longest dot product\n  WordW          SRAM word bits\n  AddrW          SRAM word address bits\n  NRdPorts       SRAM read ports (new)\n\nInside (the tile stages)\n  command decode -> loop sequencer\n  -> fetch -> stage/unpack -> PE array\n  -> accumulate -> epilogue\n  -> write back -> completion\n\nCommands (slides)\n  M.GEMV  M.GEMM  M.OUTER\nArithmetic profiles (slides)\n  BYTE_DOT     QSTATE_S16\n  QSTATE_U16   Q824_ORDERED\n\nOne clock domain: clk_i / rst_ni",
   "originalText": "Parameters\n  NSlice, Lanes  array size\n  MaxK           longest dot product\n  WordW          SRAM word bits\n  AddrW          SRAM word address bits\n  NRdPorts       SRAM read ports (new)\n\nInside (the tile stages)\n  command decode -> loop sequencer\n  -> fetch -> stage/unpack -> PE array\n  -> accumulate -> epilogue\n  -> write back -> completion\n\nCommands (slides)\n  M.GEMV  M.GEMM  M.OUTER\nArithmetic profiles (slides)\n  BYTE_DOT     QSTATE_S16\n  QSTATE_U16   Q824_ORDERED\n\nOne clock domain: clk_i / rst_ni",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
